<title>SPAIN: CYCLING-RUTA DEL SOL FOURTH STAGE PLACINGS.</title>
<headline>CYCLING-RUTA DEL SOL FOURTH STAGE PLACINGS.</headline>
<dateline>MALAGA, Spain 1997-02-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Leading placings in the</p>
<p>fourth stage of the Ruta del Sol over 176 km between Cabra and</p>
<p>Malaga on Wednesday:</p>
<p>1. Johan Museeuw (Belgium) Mapei 4 hours 23 minutes 41 seconds</p>
<p>2. Erik Zabel (Germany) Telekom</p>
<p>3. David Etxebarria (Spain) ONCE</p>
<p>4. Angelo Canzonieri (Italy) Saeco</p>
<p>5. Jesper Skibby (Denmark) TVM</p>
<p>6. Vjatceslav Ekimov (Russia) U.S. Postal</p>
<p>7. Bingen Fernandez (Spain) Euskadi</p>
<p>8. Kevin Livingston (U.S.) Cofidis</p>
<p>9. Pascal Derame (France) U.S. Postal</p>
<p>10. Cassio Freitas (France) U.S. Postal</p>
<p>Overall standings:</p>
<p>1. Zabel		     15 hours 47 minutes 13 seconds</p>
<p>2. Museeuw</p>
<p>3. Etxebarria</p>
<p>4. Canzonieri</p>
<p>5. Fernandez</p>
<p>6. Wilfried Peeters (Belgium) Mapei</p>
<p>7. Miguen Angel Pena (Spain) Banesto  all same time</p>
<p> 8. Miguel Beltran (Spain) Banesto     17 seconds behind</p>
<p> 9. Santos Gonzalez (Spain) Kelme	47</p>
<p> 10. Ekimov				    same time</p>
